## 6. Beginner ("Noob") Reality Check
| Metric | Assessment |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Upfront Capital Needed** | **$0** |
| **Technical Difficulty** | **4 / 10** (Setting up bridge pages and links) |
| **Time to First Dollar** | **14 – 30 Days** |

### Critical Pitfalls & Hidden Traps:
- Violating social media health policy: Never make medical cure claims (*"This cures diabetes"*). Use curiosity-based language (*"The morning ritual that helped balance my energy"*).
- Direct linking: Always route through a bridge page.

---

## 7. Action Plan for a Complete Beginner
```markdown
Day 1: Register a free ClickBank account and select 1 top offer in the sleep/metabolism niche.
Day 2: Create a clean 1-page bridge landing page on Beacons.ai.
Day 3: Write 10 video scripts using ChatGPT focused on nighttime wellness habits.
Day 4-7: Create and schedule 14 vertical videos in CapCut.
Day 8+: Post 2 videos daily and add your Beacons link to your bio once your account reaches link eligibility.
```

